                <span class="about-label">Meet the Owner</span>
                <h2>Driven by Excellence,<br>Defined by Service</h2>
                <p>
                    Posh Limousines of Atlanta was founded on a single belief — that every
                    passenger deserves to travel with dignity, comfort, and complete peace of
                    mind. What began as a personal commitment to world-class service has grown
                    into Atlanta's most trusted black SUV chauffeur company.
                </p>
                <p>
                    With roots deeply embedded in Atlanta's corporate and social community,
                    our founder built this company from the ground up — learning every detail
                    of the transportation industry first-hand and setting an uncompromising
                    standard for professionalism that every member of our team upholds.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Our operation runs on integrity. Every chauffeur is thoroughly
                    background-checked, professionally trained, and personally vetted to
                    ensure you receive nothing less than the premium experience our name
                    promises.
                </p>

